### Why This Should Fix (Not Add To) The Problem

- **Prevents "Whole-Repo Refactor Bombs":** By insisting on migrating and organizing one feature at a time (never the entire repo in one sweep), it keeps risk, breakage, and confusion low.
- **Purposeful Grouping:** It actively eliminates generic, ambiguous buckets (“helpers”, “utils”, etc.) and instead organizes code around what the app actually does—directly tying structure to feature ownership.
